31.3 256 560 284.7 560 320C560 355.3 531.3 384 496 384z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="conversation-view flex h-full flex-col bg-mock-app-canvas text-mock-text"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5 overflow-hidden px-3 py-4 justify-end"><div aria-hidden="false" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><p class="mx-auto w-fit py-0.5 text-[10px] text-mock-text-soft">9:14 AM / JUL 12</p></div><div aria-hidden="false" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><div class="max-w-[82%] rounded-[18px] px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug bg-mock-app-surface text-mock-text">Morning! Is the pool open today?</div></div></div><div aria-hidden="false" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex flex-col items-end"><div class="max-w-[82%] rounded-[18px] px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug bg-mock-purple-medium text-white">It is! Open 7 AM to 9 PM, and towels are out on the deck.</div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><p class="mx-auto w-fit py-0.5 text-[10px] text-mock-text-soft">11:42 AM</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><div class="max-w-[82%] rounded-[18px] px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] leading-snug bg-mock-app-surface text-mock-text">Any chance of a late checkout? Our flight isn’t till 8.</div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><div class="mx-auto flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 py-0.5"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 animate-marketing-akia-com-spin"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 640" width="12" height="12" fill="currentColor" class="text-mock-text-disabled" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M96.5 305.1C100 252.8 121.7 201.6 161.6 161.6C205.3 117.9 262.6 96 320 96C382 96 441.2 121.5 483.8 166.6L522.9 208L416 208C407.2 208 400 215.2 400 224C400 232.8 407.2 240 416 240L560 240C568.8 240 576 232.8 576 224L576 80C576 71.2 