nt-name="ShimmerText" class="shimmer-text">picks up</span> every call.</h2><p class="text-text leading-[1.4em] fade-up-item mt-6" style="--stagger:2">The same Akia that answers your messages runs your phone line. She holds a real conversation and resolves what the caller needs, then takes the payment before she hangs up.</p><div class="fade-up-item mt-8" style="--stagger:3"><a href="/agents/voice"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm whitespace-nowrap transition duration-150 ease-out motion-safe:hover:scale-[1.02] motion-safe:active:scale-[0.97] bg-white text-text hover:bg-bg font-normal text-[12px] px-[8px] py-[5px]">Explore AI Voice</button></a></div></div><div class="relative min-w-0 rounded-default overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"><div class="relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-default min-h-[460px]"><canvas class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full [-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_78%_78%_at_50%_50%,#000_55%,transparent_100%)] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_78%_78%_at_50%_50%,#000_55%,transparent_100%)] opacity-30"></canvas><div class="relative z-10 flex w-full items-center justify-center p-8 md:p-14"><div><div class="mx-auto flex w-[350px] max-w-full flex-col items-stretch"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-mock-card border border-mock-border bg-mock-bg shadow-float"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-mock-full transition-colors bg-mock-purple/50 text-mock-purple-medium"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 640" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M208.4 106.7C205 98.7 196.2 94.4 187.8 96.6L181.1 98.4C127.9 113 86.1 163.1 98.2 221.4C131.6 382 258.1 508.4 418.7 541.9C476.9 554 527.1 512.2 541.6 458.9L543.4 452.2C545.7 443.8 541.4 435 533.3 431.6L440 392.7C432.9 389.8 424.8 391.8 419.9 397.7L383.3 442.4C378.6 448.1 370.7 449.9 364.1 446.7C289.1 411.1 229.1 349.1 196