</p></div></a><a class="group flex flex-col rounded-[14px] border border-border bg-white p-1.5 w-[320px] shrink-0" aria-hidden="false" href="/case-studies/pre-arrival-automated-less-time-responding-more-revenue-per-stay"><div class="relative aspect-[1200/630] overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] bg-bg-elevated"><img alt="The Guesthouse Hotel " loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="photo-film object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="320px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Hotel-review-Chicago-facade-MAIN-IMAGE.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2FThe-Guesthouse-Ho