s is Pioneering &quot;Invisible Hospitality&quot; with Akia’s Guest Journey Platform</h3><p class="mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 text-sm font-light text-text-secondary">Revival Hotels uses Akia to power its Invisible Hospitality™ model—delivering high-touch, tech-enabled guest experiences with minimal staff by automating check-ins, messaging, access, and support across its portfolio.</p></div></a></div></div></section><section data-component-name="LatestLinks" class="py-24 md:py-32"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-12 md:mb-16 max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-text leading-tight">Just landed.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">A quick glance at what&#x27;s been keeping us busy. News from the team, and the occasional webinar worth an hour of your time.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><a class="group flex flex-col rounded-[14px] bg-white p-1.5" href="/case-studies/ai-agents-keep-guest-messaging-consistent-across-its-international-team"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-[8px]"><img alt="AI Agents keep guest messaging consistent across its international team.  " loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300 photo-film" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fhabitue-homes-property.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fhabitue-homes-property.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fhabitue-homes-property.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fays3b2uw1tc81xyw.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fhabitue-homes-property.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?ur